# The program of early-exit-without-frame.ir without the split of live ranges around the frame: what lives across the calls has one home from the entry block on, and the frame covers the early exit too
# FORM: AsRead
# OPTIONS: heat=EverythingIsHot disable=pass:InlineCalls disable=b3:SplitLiveRangesAroundFrame testing=ignore-branch-hints
# RUN: generate-code FunctionsWithFrameOnSomePaths
# CHECK: statistic FunctionsWithFrameOnSomePaths 0
# PROGRAM-OF: early-exit-without-frame.ir
